msgid "Integration"
msgstr "积分"

msgid ""
"Before starting any energy calculations, the geometry and basis set must be "
"defined in ``GEOMETRY`` and ``BASIS`` blocks, respectively. By default, two "
"electron integrals are evaluated once and stored on disk. This behaviour may"
" be overridden by using the input command ``gdirect`` (see section "
"`INTEGRAL-DIRECT CALCULATIONS (GDIRECT) <integration.html#integral-direct-"
"calculations-gdirect>`__) to force evaluation of integrals on the fly. "
"Molpro checks if the one-and two-electron integrals are available for the "
"current basis set and geometry, automatically computing them if necessary. "
"The program also recognizes automatically if only the nuclear charges have "
"been changed, as is the case in counterpoise calculations. In this case, the"
" two-electron integrals are not recomputed."
msgstr ""
"在开始任何能量计算之前，必须分别在 ``GEOMETRY`` 和 ``BASIS`` "
"块中定义几何结构和基组。默认情况下，双电子积分会被计算一次并存储在磁盘上。此行为可以通过使用输入命令 ``gdirect``\\ （参见章节 "
"`INTEGRAL-DIRECT CALCULATIONS (GDIRECT) <integration.html#integral-direct-"
"calculations-gdirect>`__\\ ）来覆盖，以强制即时计算积分。Molpro "
"会检查当前基组和几何结构下的一电子和双电子积分是否可用，并在必要时自动计算它们。程序还会自动识别是否仅更改了核电荷，例如在均衡校正计算中。在这种情况下，双电子积分不会被重新计算。"

msgid ""
"By default a point charge nuclear model is used for all atoms. "
"Alternatively, a Gaussian nuclear model can be used by setting"
msgstr "默认情况下，所有原子使用点电荷核模型。或者，可以通过设置"

msgid "``INT,FNUC=1``"
msgstr "``INT,FNUC=1``"

msgid "Sorted integrals"
msgstr "排序后的积分"

msgid ""
"If the integrals are stored on disk, immediately after evaluation they are "
"sorted into complete symmetry-packed matrices, so that later program modules"
" that use them can do so as efficiently as possible. As discussed above, it "
"is normally not necessary to call the integral and sorting programs "
"explicitly, but sometimes additional options are desired, and can be "
"specified using the ``INT`` command, which should appear after geometry and "
"basis specifications, and before any commands to evaluate an energy."
msgstr ""
"如果积分存储在磁盘上，则在计算后立即将它们排序成完整的对称性压缩矩阵，以便后续使用它们的程序模块能够尽可能高效地操作。如上所述，通常不需要显式调用积分和排序程序，但有时需要额外的选项，并且可以使用"
" ``INT`` 命令来指定，该命令应出现在几何和基组规范之后，以及任何评估能量的命令之前。"

msgid ""
"``INT,NOSORT;SORT`` can be used to explicitly separate the integral "
"evaluation and sorting steps, for example to collect separate timing data. "
"With *value* set to more than 1 in the ``SPRI`` option, all the two-electron"
" integrals are printed."
msgstr ""
"``INT,NOSORT;SORT`` 可用于显式分离积分求值和排序步骤，例如用于收集独立的计时数据。当 ``SPRI`` 选项中的 *值* 设置为大于"
" 1 时，将打印所有双电子积分。"

msgid ""
"The detailed options for the integral sort can be specified using the "
"``AOINT`` parameter set, using the input form"
msgstr "积分排序的详细选项可以使用 ``AOINT`` 参数集来指定，输入格式为"

msgid "``AOINT`` can be used with or without an explicit ``INT`` command."
msgstr "``AOINT`` 可以与显式的 ``INT`` 命令一起使用，也可以单独使用。"

msgid ""
"The following summarizes the possible keys, together with their meaning, and"
" default values."
msgstr "以下总结了可能的键及其含义和默认值。"

msgid ""
"**c_final** Integer specifying the compression algorithm to be used for the "
"final sorted integrals. Possible values are 0 (no compression), 1 "
"(compression using 1, 2, 4 or 8-byte values), 2 (2, 4 or 8 bytes), 4 (4, 8 "
"bytes) and 8. Default: 0"
msgstr ""
"**c_final** 整数，指定用于最终排序后积分的压缩算法。可能的值为 0（无压缩）、1（使用 1、2、4 或 8 字节值压缩）、2（2、4 或 8"
" 字节）、4（4、8 字节）和 8。默认值：0"

msgid ""
"**c_sort1** Integer specifying the compression algorithm for the "
"intermediate file during the sort. Default: 0"
msgstr "**c_sort1** 整数，指定排序过程中中间文件的压缩算法。默认值：0"

msgid ""
"**c_seward** Integer specifying the format of label tagging and compression "
"written by the integral program and read by the sort program. Default: 0"
msgstr "**c_seward** 整数，指定由积分程序写入并由排序程序读取的标签标记和压缩格式。默认值：0"

msgid ""
"**compress** Overall compression; c_final, c_seward and c_sort1 are forced "
"internally to be not less than this parameter. Default: 1"
msgstr "**compress** 总体压缩；c_final、c_seward 和 c_sort1 在内部被强制设定为不小于此参数。默认值：1"

msgid ""
"**thresh** Real giving the truncation threshold for compression. Default: "
":math:`0.0`, which means use the integral evaluation threshold "
"(``GTHRESH,TWOINT``)"
msgstr ""
"**thresh** 实数，给出压缩的截断阈值。默认值：\\ :math:`0.0`\\ ，表示使用积分求值阈值（\\ "
"``GTHRESH,TWOINT``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"**io** String specifying how the sorted integrals are written. Possible "
"values are ``molpro`` (standard ``Molpro`` record on file 1) and ``eaf`` "
"(Exclusive-access file). ``eaf`` is permissible only if the program has been"
" configured for MPP usage, and at present ``molpro`` is implemented only for"
" serial execution. ``molpro`` is required if the integrals are to be used in"
" a restart job. For maximum efficiency on a parallel machine, ``eaf`` should"
" be used, since in that case the integrals are distributed on separate "
"processor-local files."
msgstr ""
"**io** 字符串，指定排序后的积分如何写入。可能的值为 ``molpro``\\ （文件1上的标准 ``Molpro`` 记录）和 "
"``eaf``\\ （独占访问文件）。仅当程序已配置为 MPP 使用时才允许使用 ``eaf``\\ ，并且目前 ``molpro`` "
"仅针对串行执行实现。如果积分要在重启作业中使用，则需要 ``molpro``\\ 。为了在并行机器上获得最高效率，应使用 ``eaf``\\ "
"，因为在这种情况下积分分布在单独的处理器本地文件上。"

msgid ""
"For backward-compatibility purposes, two convenience commands are also "
"defined: ``COMPRESS`` is equivalent to ``AOINT,COMPRESS=1``, and "
"``NOCOMPRESS`` is equivalent to ``AOINT,COMPRESS=0``."
msgstr ""
"为了向后兼容，还定义了两个便捷命令：\\ ``COMPRESS`` 等同于 ``AOINT,COMPRESS=1``\\ ，\\ "
"``NOCOMPRESS`` 等同于 ``AOINT,COMPRESS=0``\\ 。"

msgid "Imported hamiltonian"
msgstr "导入的哈密顿量"

msgid ""
"It is possible to import the second-quantised hamiltonian completely from "
"outside ``Molpro``. In order to do so, it is necessary to set up a job that "
"simulates the desired calculation by having a basis set of exactly the same "
"dimensions as the one to be imported. One can then import the hamiltonian "
"using the command"
msgstr ""
"可以从 ``Molpro`` "
"外部完全导入二次量子化的哈密顿量。为此，需要设置一个作业，通过使用与要导入的基组维度完全相同的基组来模拟所需的计算。然后可以使用以下命令导入哈密顿量"

msgid ""
"*filename* is the name of a file that contains the hamiltonian in `FCIDUMP "
"<https://github.com/molpro/fcidump>`__ format, which can be produced using "
"Molpro’s ``{FCI,DUMP=}`` facility, or by another method."
msgstr ""
"*文件名* 是一个包含 `FCIDUMP <https://bitbucket.org/pjknowles/fcidump>`__ "
"格式哈密顿量的文件名称，该文件可以使用 Molpro 的 ``{FCI,DUMP=}`` 功能或其他方法生成。"

msgid ""
"Note that this facility is fragile, and is limited to energy-only "
"calculations. Attempts to calculate gradients or other properties will "
"inevitably fail. At present, the implementation does not support the use of "
"point-group symmetry."
msgstr "请注意，此功能较为脆弱，且仅限于能量计算。尝试计算梯度或其他性质将不可避免地失败。目前，该实现不支持点群对称性的使用。"

msgid "INTEGRAL-DIRECT CALCULATIONS (GDIRECT)"
msgstr "积分直接计算 (GDIRECT)"

msgid "References:"
msgstr "参考文献："

msgid ""
"Most methods implemented in ``MOLPRO`` can be performed integral-direct, "
"i.e., the methods are integral driven with the two-electron integrals in the"
" AO basis being recomputed whenever needed, avoiding the bottleneck of "
"storing these quantities on disk. Exceptions are currently full CI (FCI), "
"perturbative triple excitations (T), ``UMP2``, ``RMP2``, ``CPP``, "
"``MRCI-F12``, and ``RS2-F12``. For small molecules, this requires "
"significantly more CPU time, but reduces the disk space requirements when "
"using large basis sets. However, due to efficient prescreening techniques, "
"the scaling of the computational cost with molecular size is lower in "
"integral-direct mode than in conventional mode, and therefore integral-"
"direct calculations for extended molecules may even be less expensive than "
"conventional ones. The break-even point depends strongly on the size of the "
"molecule, the hardware, and the basis set. Depending on the available disk "
"space, calculations with more than 150–200 basis functions in one symmetry "
"should normally be done in integral-direct mode."
msgstr ""
"``MOLPRO`` "
"中实现的大多数方法都可以以积分直接模式执行，即这些方法是积分驱动的，原子轨道基组中的双电子积分在需要时重新计算，避免了将这些量存储在磁盘上的瓶颈。目前的例外包括全组态相互作用"
" (FCI)、微扰三重激发 (T)、\\ ``UMP2``\\ 、\\ ``RMP2``\\ 、\\ ``CPP``\\ 、\\ "
"``MRCI-F12`` 和 ``RS2-F12``\\ 。对于小分子，这需要显著更多的 CPU "
"时间，但在使用大基组时减少了磁盘空间需求。然而，由于高效的预筛选技术，计算成本随分子大小的标度在积分直接模式下比在传统模式下更低，因此对于扩展分子的积分直接计算甚至可能比传统计算成本更低。盈亏平衡点强烈依赖于分子大小、硬件和基组。根据可用的磁盘空间，在一个对称性中具有超过"
" 150–200 个基函数的计算通常应在积分直接模式下进行。"

msgid ""
"The integral-direct implementation in ``MOLPRO`` involves three different "
"procedures: (i) Fock matrix evaluation (``DFOCK``), (ii) integral "
"transformation (``DTRAF``), and (iii) external exchange operators "
"(``DKEXT``). Specific options and thresholds exist for all three programs, "
"but it is also possible to specify the most important thresholds by general "
"parameters, which are used as defaults for all programs."
msgstr ""
"``MOLPRO`` 中的积分直接实现涉及三种不同的程序：(i) Fock 矩阵计算 (``DFOCK``)，(ii) 积分变换 "
"(``DTRAF``)，以及 (iii) 外部交换算符 "
"(``DKEXT``)。所有三个程序都有特定的选项和阈值，但也可以通过通用参数指定最重要的阈值，这些参数将用作所有程序的默认值。"

msgid ""
"Normally, appropriate default values are automatically used by the program, "
"and in most cases no parameters need to be specified on the ``DIRECT`` "
"directive. However, in order to guarantee sufficient accuracy, the default "
"thresholds are quite strict, and in calculations for extended systems larger"
" values might be useful to reduce the CPU time."
msgstr ""
"通常，程序会自动使用适当的默认值，在大多数情况下无需在\\ ``DIRECT``\\ "
"指令上指定参数。然而，为了保证足够的精度，默认阈值相当严格，对于扩展体系的计算，使用更大的值可能有助于减少CPU时间。"

msgid "The format of the ``DIRECT`` directive is"
msgstr "``DIRECT``\\ 指令的格式为"

msgid ""
"The following table summarizes the possible keys and their meaning. The "
"default values are given in the subsequent table. In various cases there is "
"a hierarchy of default values. For instance, if ``THREST_D2EXT`` is not "
"given, one of the following is used: [``THR_D2EXT``, ``THREST_DTRAF``, "
"``THR_DTRAF``, ``THREST``, *default*]. The list in brackets is checked from "
"left to right, and the first one found in the input is used. *default* is a "
"default value which depends on the energy threshold and the basis set (the "
"threshold is reduced if the overlap matrix contains very small eigenvalues)."
msgstr ""
"下表总结了可能的键及其含义。默认值在后续表格中给出。在许多情况下，默认值存在层级关系。例如，如果未指定 ``THREST_D2EXT``\\ "
"，则使用以下值之一：[``THR_D2EXT``, ``THREST_DTRAF``, ``THR_DTRAF``, ``THREST``, "
"*default*]。括号内的列表从左到右检查，并使用输入中找到的第一个值。\\ *default* "
"是一个取决于能量阈值和基组的默认值（如果重叠矩阵包含非常小的特征值，则阈值会降低）。"

msgid ""
"``MAXRED`` Maximum number of iterations after which thresholds are reduced "
"to their final values in ``CI`` and ``CCSD`` calculations. If ``MAXRED``\\ "
"=0, the final thresholds will be used in ``CI`` and ``CCSD`` from the "
"beginning (same as ``THRMAX``\\ =0, but ``MAXRED`` has no effect on "
"``DSCF``. In the latter case a fixed value of 10 is used."
msgstr ""
"``MAXRED`` 在 ``CI`` 和 ``CCSD`` 计算中，阈值被降低至其最终值之前允许的最大迭代次数。如果 ``MAXRED``\\ "
"=0，则在 ``CI`` 和 ``CCSD`` 中从一开始就使用最终阈值（与 ``THRMAX``\\ =0 效果相同），但 ``MAXRED`` 对 "
"``DSCF`` 没有影响。在后一种情况下，使用固定值 10。"

msgid ""
"``VARRED`` Thresholds are reduced to their final values if the sum of "
"squared amplitude changes is smaller than this value."
msgstr "``VARRED`` 如果振幅变化的平方和小于此值，则阈值将降低至其最终值。"

msgid ""
"``THREST_DSCF`` Final prescreening threshold in direct SCF. If given, it "
"replaces the value of ``THREST``."
msgstr "``THREST_DSCF`` 直接自洽场中的最终预筛选阈值。若指定，将替换 ``THREST`` 的值。"

msgid ""
"``THRMAX_DSCF`` Initial prescreening threshold in direct SCF. This is used "
"for the first 7-10 iterations. Once a certain accuracy is reached, the "
"threshold is reduced to ``THREST_DSCF``"
msgstr ""
"``THRMAX_DSCF`` 直接自洽场中的初始预筛选阈值。用于前 7-10 次迭代。达到一定精度后，阈值降至 ``THREST_DSCF``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``SCREEN_DTRAF`` If given, replaces value of :math:`{\\tt SCREEN}` for "
"``DTRAF``."
msgstr "``SCREEN_DTRAF`` 若指定，则替换 ``DTRAF`` 中 :math:`{\\tt SCREEN}` 的值。"

msgid ""
"``MAXSHLQ1_DTRAF`` Maximum size of merged shells in the first quarter "
"transformation step (0: not used)."
msgstr "``MAXSHLQ1_DTRAF`` 第一个四分之一变换步骤中合并壳层的最大尺寸（0：不使用）。"

msgid ""
"``MINSHLQ1_DTRAF`` Shells are only merged if their size is smaller than this"
" value (0: not used)."
msgstr "``MINSHLQ1_DTRAF`` 仅当壳层尺寸小于此值时才会被合并（0：不使用）。"

msgid ""
"``MAXSHLQ2_DTRAF`` Maximum size of merged shells in the second quarter "
"transformation step (0: not used)."
msgstr "``MAXSHLQ2_DTRAF`` 第二季度变换步骤中合并壳层的最大尺寸（0：未使用）。"

msgid ""
"``MINSHLQ2_DTRAF`` Shells are only merged if their size is smaller than this"
" value (0: not used)."
msgstr "``MINSHLQ2_DTRAF`` 仅当壳层尺寸小于此值时才会被合并（0：未使用）。"

msgid ""
"``MAXCEN_DTRAF`` Maximum number of centres in merged shells (0: no limit)."
msgstr "``MAXCEN_DTRAF`` 合并壳层中的最大中心数（0：无限制）。"

msgid "``PRINT_DTRAF`` Print parameter for ``DTRAF``."
msgstr "``PRINT_DTRAF`` ``DTRAF`` 的打印参数。"

msgid ""
"``THR_DTRAF`` General threshold for ``DTRAF``. If given, this is taken as "
"default value for all thresholds described below."
msgstr "``THR_DTRAF`` ``DTRAF`` 的通用阈值。如果指定，则作为下述所有阈值的默认值。"

msgid ""
"``THR_D2EXT`` General threshold for generation of 2-external integrals. If "
"given, this is used as a default for all ``D2EXT`` thresholds described "
"below."
msgstr "``THR_D2EXT`` 生成 2-外部积分的通用阈值。如果指定，将用作下面描述的所有 ``D2EXT`` 阈值的默认值。"

msgid ""
"``THR_D3EXT`` General threshold for generation of 3-external integrals. If "
"given, this is used as a default for all ``D3EXT`` thresholds described "
"below."
msgstr "``THR_D3EXT`` 生成 3-外部积分的通用阈值。如果指定，将用作下面描述的所有 ``D3EXT`` 阈值的默认值。"

msgid ""
"``THR_D4EXT`` General threshold for generation of 4-external integrals. If "
"given, this is used as a default for all ``D4EXT`` thresholds described "
"below."
msgstr "``THR_D4EXT`` 用于生成4-外部积分的通用阈值。如果指定，将用作下述所有 ``D4EXT`` 阈值的默认值。"

msgid ""
"``THR_DCCSD`` General threshold for generalized transformation needed in "
"each CCSD iteration. If given, this is used as a default for "
"``THREST_DCCSD``, ``THRINT_DCCSD``, and ``THRPROD_DCCSD`` described below."
msgstr ""
"``THR_DCCSD`` 用于每次CCSD迭代中所需广义变换的通用阈值。如果指定，将用作下述 ``THREST_DCCSD``\\ 、\\ "
"``THRINT_DCCSD`` 和 ``THRPROD_DCCSD`` 的默认值。"

msgid ""
"``THR_DMP2`` General threshold for generation of 2-external integrals in "
"DMP2. If given, this is used as a default for all ``DMP2`` thresholds "
"described below."
msgstr "``THR_DMP2`` DMP2 中生成 2-外部积分的通用阈值。如果指定，则用作下述所有 ``DMP2`` 阈值的默认值。"

msgid ""
"``THR_LMP2`` General threshold for generation of 2-external integrals in "
"linear scaling LMP2. If given, this is used as a default for all ``LMP2`` "
"thresholds described below."
msgstr ""
"``THR_LMP2`` 用于线性标度 LMP2 中生成 2-外部积分的通用阈值。如果指定，则用作下面描述的所有 ``LMP2`` 阈值的默认值。"

msgid ""
"``SCREEN_DKEXT`` if given, replaces value of :math:`{\\tt SCREEN}` for "
"``DKEXT``."
msgstr "``SCREEN_DKEXT`` 如果指定，则替换 ``DKEXT`` 的 :math:`{\\tt SCREEN}` 值。"

msgid ""
"``MAXSIZE_DKEXT`` Largest size of merged shells in ``DKEXT`` (0: not used)."
msgstr "``MAXSIZE_DKEXT`` ``DKEXT`` 中合并壳层的最大尺寸（0：不使用）。"

msgid ""
"``MINSIZE_DKEXT`` Shells are only merged if their size is smaller than this "
"value. (0: not used)."
msgstr "``MINSIZE_DKEXT`` 仅当壳层尺寸小于此值时才会合并（0：不使用）。"

msgid ""
"``THR_DKEXT`` General threshold for ``DKEXT``. If given, this is used as a "
"default for all ``DKEXT`` thresholds described below."
msgstr "``THR_DKEXT`` ``DKEXT`` 的通用阈值。如果指定，将用作下面描述的所有 ``DKEXT`` 阈值的默认值。"

msgid ""
"``THRMAX_DKEXT`` Initial value for ``THREST_DKEXT`` in ``CI``, and ``CCSD`` "
"calculations. If nonzero. it will also be used for ``DKEXT`` in ``MP3`` and "
"``MP4(SDQ)`` calculations. The threshold will be reduced to ``THREST_DKEXT``"
" once a certain accuracy has been reached (see ``VARRED``), or latest after "
"``MAXRED`` iterations. The initial thresholds ``THRINT_DKEXT`` and "
"``THRPROD_DKEXT`` are obtained by multiplying their input (or default) "
"values by ``THRMAX_DKEXT``/``THREST_DKEXT``, with the restriction that the "
"initial values cannot be smaller than the final ones."
msgstr ""
"``THRMAX_DKEXT`` ``CI`` 和 ``CCSD`` 计算中 ``THREST_DKEXT`` 的初始值。如果非零，它也将用于 "
"``MP3`` 和 ``MP4(SDQ)`` 计算中的 ``DKEXT``\\ 。一旦达到特定精度（参见 ``VARRED``\\ ），或最迟在 "
"``MAXRED`` 次迭代后，该阈值将降至 ``THREST_DKEXT``\\ 。初始阈值 ``THRINT_DKEXT`` 和 "
"``THRPROD_DKEXT`` 是通过将其输入（或默认）值乘以 ``THRMAX_DKEXT``/``THREST_DKEXT`` "
"得到的，但限制条件是初始值不能小于最终值。"

