"For historical reasons, many options have alias names. The following tables "
"summarize the default values for all options and thresholds and also gives "
"possible alias names."
msgstr "由于历史原因，许多选项具有别名。以下表格总结了所有选项和阈值的默认值，并给出了可能的别名。"

