msgid ""
"Integral-direct calculations are requested by the ``DIRECT`` or ``GDIRECT`` "
"directives. If one of these cards is given outside the input of specific "
"programs it acts globally, i.e. all subsequent calculations are performed in"
" integral-direct mode. On the other hand, if the ``DIRECT`` card is part of "
"the input of specific programs (e.g. ``HF``, ``CCSD``), it affects only this"
" program. The ``GDIRECT`` directive is not recognized by individual programs"
" and always acts globally. Normally, all calculations in one job will be "
"done integral-direct, and then a ``DIRECT`` ``or GDIRECT`` card is required "
"before the first energy calculation. However, further ``DIRECT`` or "
"``GDIRECT`` directives can be given in order to modify specific options or "
"thresholds for particular programs."
msgstr ""
"积分直接计算通过 ``DIRECT`` 或 ``GDIRECT`` "
"指令请求。如果这些卡片之一出现在特定程序的输入之外，则其作用为全局性的，即所有后续计算都在积分直接模式下执行。另一方面，如果 ``DIRECT`` "
"卡片是特定程序（例如 ``HF``\\ 、\\ ``CCSD``\\ ）输入的一部分，则仅影响该程序。\\ ``GDIRECT`` "
"指令不被各个程序识别，始终全局生效。通常，一个作业中的所有计算都将以积分直接方式完成，因此需要在首次能量计算之前给出 ``DIRECT`` 或 "
"``GDIRECT`` 卡片。然而，可以给出更多的 ``DIRECT`` 或 ``GDIRECT`` 指令，以便为特定程序修改特定选项或阈值。"

msgid "``DIRECT, key1=value1, key2=value2…``"
msgstr "``DIRECT, key1=value1, key2=value2…``"

msgid "**\\*\\*General Options (apply to all programs):**"
msgstr "**\\*\\*通用选项（适用于所有程序）：**"

msgid "\\*\\*"
msgstr "\\*\\*"

msgid ""
"``THREST`` Integral prescreening threshold. The calculation of an integral "
"shell block is skipped if the product of the largest estimated integral "
"value (based on the Cauchy-Schwarz inequality) and the largest density "
"matrix element contributing to the shell block is smaller than this value. "
"In ``DTRAF`` and ``DKEXT`` effective density matrices are constructed from "
"the MO coefficients and amplitudes, respectively."
msgstr ""
"``THREST`` 积分预筛选阈值。如果最大估计积分值（基于 Cauchy-Schwarz "
"不等式）与对该壳层块有贡献的最大密度矩阵元的乘积小于此值，则跳过该积分壳层块的计算。在 ``DTRAF`` 和 ``DKEXT`` "
"中，有效密度矩阵分别由 MO 系数和振幅构建。"

msgid ""
"``THRINT`` Integral prescreening threshold. This applies to the product of "
"the exact (i.e. computed) integral value and a density matrix. This "
"threshold is only used in ``DTRAF`` and ``DKEXT``. A shell block of "
"integrals is skipped if the product of the largest integral and the largest "
"element of the effective density matrix contributing to the shell block is "
"smaller than this threshold. If it is set negative, no computed integrals "
"will be neglected."
msgstr ""
"``THRINT`` 积分预筛选阈值。这适用于精确（即计算得到的）积分值与密度矩阵的乘积。该阈值仅在 ``DTRAF`` 和 ``DKEXT`` "
"中使用。如果最大积分与对该壳层块有贡献的有效密度矩阵的最大元素的乘积小于此阈值，则跳过该壳层块积分。如果设为负值，则不会忽略任何已计算的积分。"

msgid ""
"``THRPROD`` Prescreening threshold for products of integrals and MO-"
"coefficients (``DTRAF``) or amplitudes (``DKEXT``). Shell blocks of MO "
"coefficients or amplitudes are neglected if the product of the largest "
"integral in the shell block and the largest coefficient is smaller than this"
" value. If this is set negative, no product screening is performed."
msgstr ""
"``THRPROD`` 积分与 MO 系数（\\ ``DTRAF``\\ ）或振幅（\\ ``DKEXT``\\ "
"）乘积的预筛选阈值。如果壳层块中最大积分与最大系数的乘积小于此值，则忽略该 MO 系数或振幅壳层块。如果设为负值，则不执行乘积筛选。"

msgid ""
"``THRMAX`` Initial value of the prescreening threshold ``THREST`` for "
"``DFOCK`` and ``DKEXT`` in iterative methods (``SCF``, ``CI``, ``CCSD``). If"
" nonzero, it will also be used for ``DKEXT`` in ``MP3`` and ``MP4(SDQ)`` "
"calculations. The threshold will be reduced to ``THREST`` once a certain "
"accuracy has been reached (see ``VARRED``), or latest after ``MAXRED`` "
"iterations. In ``CI`` and ``CCSD`` calculations, also the initial thresholds"
" ``THRINT_DKEXT`` and ``THRPROD_DKEXT`` are influenced by this value. For a "
"description, see ``THRMAX_DKEXT``. If ``THRMAX``\\ =0, the final thresholds "
"will be used from the beginning in all methods."
msgstr ""
"``THRMAX`` ``DFOCK`` 和 ``DKEXT`` 在迭代方法（\\ ``SCF``\\ 、\\ ``CI``\\ 、\\ "
"``CCSD``\\ ）中预筛选阈值 ``THREST`` 的初始值。如果非零，它也将用于 ``MP3`` 和 ``MP4(SDQ)`` 计算中的 "
"``DKEXT``\\ 。一旦达到一定精度（参见 ``VARRED``\\ ），或最迟在 ``MAXRED`` 次迭代之后，阈值将降低到 "
"``THREST``\\ 。在 ``CI`` 和 ``CCSD`` 计算中，初始阈值 ``THRINT_DKEXT`` 和 "
"``THRPROD_DKEXT`` 也受此值影响。有关说明，请参见 ``THRMAX_DKEXT``\\ 。如果 ``THRMAX``\\ "
"=0，则在所有方法中从一开始就使用最终阈值。"

msgid "``SCREEN`` Enables or disables prescreening."
msgstr "``SCREEN`` 启用或禁用预筛选。"

msgid ""
"``SCREEN$\\ge 0$: full screening enabled.\\\\`` ``SCREEN``\\ :math:`\\lt 0`:"
" ``THRPROD`` is unused. No density screening in direct SCF. ``SCREEN``\\ "
":math:`\\lt -1`: ``THRINT`` is unused. ``SCREEN``\\ :math:`\\lt -2`: "
"``THREST`` is unused."
msgstr ""
"``SCREEN$\\ge 0$: 启用完整筛选。\\\\`` ``SCREEN``\\ :math:`\\lt 0`\\ ：不使用 "
"``THRPROD``\\ 。直接 SCF 中不做密度筛选。\\ ``SCREEN``\\ :math:`\\lt -1`\\ ：不使用 "
"``THRINT``\\ 。\\ ``SCREEN``\\ :math:`\\lt -2`\\ ：不使用 ``THREST``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``SWAP`` Enables or disables label swapping in ``SEWARD``. Test purpose "
"only."
msgstr "``SWAP`` 启用或禁用 ``SEWARD`` 中的标签交换。仅用于测试目的。"

msgid "**\\*\\*Specific options for direct SCF (``DFOCK``):**"
msgstr "**\\*\\*直接 SCF（``DFOCK``）的特定选项：**"

msgid ""
"``SWAP_DFOCK`` Enables or disables label swapping in fock matrix calculation"
" (test purpose only)."
msgstr "``SWAP_DFOCK`` 启用或禁用 Fock 矩阵计算中的标签交换（仅用于测试目的）。"

msgid "**\\*\\*General options for direct integral transformation (``DTRAF``)**:"
msgstr "**\\*\\*直接积分变换（``DTRAF``）的通用选项**："

msgid "``PAGE_DTRAF`` Selects the transformation method."
msgstr "``PAGE_DTRAF`` 选择变换方法。"

msgid ""
"``PAGE_DTRAF=0: use minimum memory algorithm, requiring four integral "
"evaluations.\\\\`` ``PAGE_DTRAF=1``: use paging algorithm,leading to the "
"minimum CPU time (one integral evaluation for DMP2/LMP2 and two otherwise)."
msgstr ""
"``PAGE_DTRAF=0：使用最小内存算法，需要四次积分求值。\\\\`` ``PAGE_DTRAF=1``\\ ：使用分页算法，导致最小 CPU "
"时间（对于 DMP2/LMP2 为一次积分求值，其他情况为两次）。"

msgid "**\\*\\*General thresholds for all direct integral transformations:**\\*\\*"
msgstr "**\\*\\*所有直接积分变换的通用阈值：**\\*\\*"

msgid "``THREST_DTRAF`` AO prescreening threshold for ``DTRAF``."
msgstr "``THREST_DTRAF`` ``DTRAF`` 的 AO 预筛选阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_DTRAF, THREST, default].``"
msgstr "``默认值：[THR_DTRAF, THREST, default]。``"

msgid "``THRINT_DTRAF`` Integral threshold for ``DTRAF``."
msgstr "``THRINT_DTRAF`` ``DTRAF`` 的积分阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_DTRAF, THRINT, default].``"
msgstr "``默认值：[THR_DTRAF, THRINT, default]。``"

msgid "``THRPROD_DTRAF`` Product threshold for ``DTRAF``."
msgstr "``THRPROD_DTRAF`` ``DTRAF`` 的乘积阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_DTRAF, THRPROD, default].\\\\``"
msgstr "``默认值：[THR_DTRAF, THRPROD, default]。\\\\``"

msgid "**\\*\\*Thresholds specific to direct integral transformations:**\\*\\*"
msgstr "**\\*\\*直接积分变换特有的阈值：**\\*\\*"

msgid ""
"``THREST_D2EXT`` Prescreening threshold for generation of 2-external "
