msgstr "``THRPROD_D2EXT`` 生成 2-外部积分 的乘积阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_D2EXT, THRPROD_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRPROD, default].\\\\``"
msgstr "``默认值：[THR_D2EXT, THRPROD_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRPROD, default]。\\\\``"

msgid ""
"``THREST_D3EXT`` Prescreening threshold for generation of 3-external "
"integrals."
msgstr "``THREST_D3EXT`` 生成 3-外部积分 的预筛选阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_D3EXT, THREST_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THREST, default].``"
msgstr "``默认值：[THR_D3EXT, THREST_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THREST, default]。``"

msgid ""
"``THRINT_D3EXT`` Integral threshold for generation of 3-external integrals."
msgstr "``THRINT_D3EXT`` 生成 3-外部积分 的积分阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_D3EXT, THRINT_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRINT, default].``"
msgstr "``默认值：[THR_D3EXT, THRINT_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRINT, default]。``"

msgid ""
"``THRPROD_D3EXT`` Product threshold for generation of 3-external integrals."
msgstr "``THRPROD_D3EXT`` 生成 3-外部积分 的乘积阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_D3EXT, THRPROD_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRPROD, default].\\\\``"
msgstr "``默认值：[THR_D3EXT, THRPROD_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRPROD, default]。\\\\``"

msgid ""
"``THREST_D4EXT`` Prescreening threshold for generation of 4-external "
"integrals."
msgstr "``THREST_D4EXT`` 生成 4-外部积分 的预筛选阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_D4EXT, THREST_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THREST, default].``"
msgstr "``默认值：[THR_D4EXT, THREST_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THREST, default]。``"

msgid ""
"``THRINT_D4EXT`` Integral threshold for generation of 4-external integrals."
msgstr "``THRINT_D4EXT`` 生成 4-外部积分 的积分阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_D4EXT, THRINT_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRINT, default].``"
msgstr "``默认值：[THR_D4EXT, THRINT_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRINT, default]。``"

msgid ""
"``THRPROD_D4EXT`` Product threshold for generation of 4-external integrals."
msgstr "``THRPROD_D4EXT`` 生成 4-外部积分 的乘积阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_D4EXT, THRPROD_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRPROD, default].\\\\``"
msgstr "``默认值：[THR_D4EXT, THRPROD_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRPROD, default]。\\\\``"

msgid "``THREST_DCCSD`` Prescreening threshold for DCCSD transformation."
msgstr "``THREST_DCCSD`` DCCSD 变换的预筛选阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_DCCSD, THREST_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THREST, default].``"
msgstr "``默认值：[THR_DCCSD, THREST_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THREST, default]。``"

msgid "``THRINT_DCCSD`` Integral threshold for DCCSD transformation."
msgstr "``THRINT_DCCSD`` DCCSD 变换的积分阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_DCCSD, THRINT_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRINT, default].``"
msgstr "``默认值：[THR_DCCSD, THRINT_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRINT, default]。``"

msgid "``THRPROD_DCCSD`` Product threshold for DCCSD transformation."
msgstr "``THRPROD_DCCSD`` DCCSD 变换的乘积阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_DCCSD, THRPROD_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRPROD, default].``"
msgstr "``默认值：[THR_DCCSD, THRPROD_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRPROD, default]。``"

msgid ""
"``THRMAX_DCCSD`` Initial value for ``THREST_DCCSD`` in ``CCSD`` "
"calculations. The threshold will be reduced to ``THREST_DCCSD`` once a "
"certain accuracy has been reached (see ``VARRED``), or latest after "
"``MAXRED`` iterations. The initial thresholds ``THRINT_DCCSD`` and "
"``THRPROD_DCCSD`` are obtained by multiplying their input (or default) "
"values by ``THRMAX_DCCSD``/``THREST_DCCSD``, with the restriction that the "
"initial values cannot be smaller than the final ones."
msgstr ""
"``THRMAX_DCCSD`` 在 ``CCSD`` 计算中 ``THREST_DCCSD`` 的初始值。一旦达到某种精度（参见 "
"``VARRED``\\ ），或最迟在 ``MAXRED`` 次迭代之后，该阈值将降低到 ``THREST_DCCSD``\\ 。初始阈值 "
"``THRINT_DCCSD`` 和 ``THRPROD_DCCSD`` 通过将其输入（或默认）值乘以 "
"``THRMAX_DCCSD``/``THREST_DCCSD`` 得到，但初始值不能小于最终值。"

msgid "**\\*\\*Specific options for direct MP2 (``DMP2``)**:\\*\\*"
msgstr "**\\*\\*直接 MP2（``DMP2``）的特定选项**：\\*\\*"

msgid "``DMP2`` Selects the transformation method for direct ``MP2``:"
msgstr "``DMP2`` 选择直接 ``MP2`` 的变换方法："

msgid ""
"``DMP2``\\ =\\ :math:`-1`: automatic selection, depending on the available "
"memory. ``DMP2=0: use fully direct method for DMP2 (min. two integral "
"evaluations, possibly multipassing, no disk space).\\\\`` ``DMP2``\\ =1: use"
" semi-direct method for ``DMP2`` (one to four integral evaluations, "
"depending on ``PAGE_DTRAF``). ``DMP2``\\ =2: use ``DKEXT`` to compute "
"exchange operators in ``DMP2`` (one integral evaluation). This is only "
"useful in local ``DMP2`` calculations with many distant pairs."
msgstr ""
"``DMP2``\\ =\\ :math:`-1`\\ ：自动选择，取决于可用内存。 ``DMP2=0: use fully direct method"
" for DMP2 (min. two integral evaluations, possibly multipassing, no disk "
"space).\\\\`` ``DMP2``\\ =1：对 ``DMP2`` 使用半直接方法（一到四次积分求值，取决于 ``PAGE_DTRAF``\\"
" ）。 ``DMP2``\\ =2：使用 ``DKEXT`` 在 ``DMP2`` 中计算交换算符（一次积分求值）。这仅在具有许多远对的局域 "
"``DMP2`` 计算中有用。"

msgid ""
"``THREST_DMP2`` Prescreening threshold for generation of 2-external "
"integrals."
msgstr "``THREST_DMP2`` 生成 2-外部积分 的预筛选阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_DMP2, THREST_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THREST, default].``"
msgstr "``默认值：[THR_DMP2, THREST_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THREST, default]。``"

msgid ""
"``THRINT_DMP2`` Integral threshold for generation of 2-external integrals."
msgstr "``THRINT_DMP2`` 生成 2-外部积分 的积分阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_DMP2, THRINT_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRINT, default].``"
msgstr "``Defaults: [THR_DMP2, THRINT_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRINT, default].``"

msgid ""
"``THRPROD_DMP2`` Product threshold for generation of 2-external integrals"
msgstr "``THRPROD_DMP2`` 生成2-外部积分的乘积阈值"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_DMP2, THRPROD_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRPROD, default].\\\\``"
msgstr "``Defaults: [THR_DMP2, THRPROD_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRPROD, default].\\\\``"

msgid "**\\*\\*Specific options for direct local MP2 (``LMP2``)**:\\*\\*"
msgstr "**\\*\\*直接局域 MP2（``LMP2``）的特定选项**：\\*\\*"

msgid "``DTRAF`` Selects the transformation method for direct ``LMP2``:"
msgstr "``DTRAF`` 选择直接 ``LMP2`` 的变换方法："

msgid ""
"``DTRAF`` :math:`\\geq 0`: generates the 2-external integrals (exchange "
"operators) first in AO basis and transforms these thereafter in a second "
"step to the projected, local basis. The disk storage requirements hence "
"scale cubically with molecular size. ``DTRAF`` :math:`= -1`: generates the "
"2-external integrals (exchange operators) directly in projected basis. The "
"disk storage requirements hence scale linearly with molecular size. This "
"(together with ``PAGE_DTRAF`` = 0) is the recommended algorithm for very "
"large molecules (cf. linear scaling LMP2, chapter :doc:`PAO-based local "
"correlation treatments <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments>`). ``DTRAF``"
" :math:`= -2`: alternative algorithm to generate the exchange operators "
"directly in projected basis. Usually, this algorithm turns out to be "
"computationally more expensive than the one selected with ``DTRAF`` :math:`="
" -1`. Note, that neither ``DTRAF`` :math:`= -1` nor ``DTRAF`` :math:`= -2` "
"work in the context of LMP2 gradients."
msgstr ""
"``DTRAF`` :math:`\\geq 0`\\ ：首先在 AO "
"基中生成2-外部积分（交换算符），随后在第二步中将其变换到投影局域基。因此磁盘存储需求随分子尺寸呈三次方标度。\\ ``DTRAF`` :math:`="
" -1`\\ ：直接在投影基中生成2-外部积分（交换算符）。因此磁盘存储需求随分子尺寸呈线性标度。该算法（连同 ``PAGE_DTRAF`` = "
"0）是用于超大分子的推荐算法（参见线性标度 LMP2，章节 :doc:`基于 PAO 的局域相关处理 <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments>`\\ ）。\\ ``DTRAF`` :math:`= -2`\\ "
"：直接在投影基中生成交换算符的替代算法。通常，该算法在计算上比 ``DTRAF`` :math:`= -1` 所选的算法更昂贵。注意，\\ "
"``DTRAF`` :math:`= -1` 和 ``DTRAF`` :math:`= -2` 均不能在 LMP2 梯度的上下文中工作。"

msgid ""
"``THREST_LMP2`` Prescreening threshold for generation of 2-external "
"integrals."
msgstr "``THREST_LMP2`` 生成2-外部积分的预筛选阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_LMP2, THREST_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THREST, default].``"
msgstr "``Defaults: [THR_LMP2, THREST_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THREST, default].``"

msgid "``THRQ1_LMP2`` Threshold used in the first quarter transformation."
msgstr "``THRQ1_LMP2`` 用于第一次四分之一变换的阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_LMP2, THRPROD_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRPROD, default].``"
msgstr "``Defaults: [THR_LMP2, THRPROD_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRPROD, default].``"

msgid ""
"``THRQ2_LMP2`` Threshold used in the second and subsequent quarter "
"transformations."
msgstr "``THRQ2_LMP2`` 用于第二次及后续四分之一变换的阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_LMP2, THRINT_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRINT, default].``"
msgstr "``Defaults: [THR_LMP2, THRINT_DTRAF, THR_DTRAF, THRINT, default].``"

msgid ""
"``THRAO_ATTEN`` Special threshold for prescreening of attenuated integrals "
":math:`(\\mu \\mu | \\nu \\nu)`"
msgstr "``THRAO_ATTEN`` 用于衰减积分 :math:`(\\mu \\mu | \\nu \\nu)` 预筛选的特殊阈值"

msgid "``Default: THREST_LMP2\\\\``"
msgstr "``Default: THREST_LMP2\\\\``"

msgid ""
"**\\*\\*Options for integral-direct computation of external exchange "
"operators (``DKEXT``):**\\*\\*"
msgstr "**\\*\\*外部交换算符积分直接计算的选项（``DKEXT``）：**\\*\\*"

msgid "``DKEXT`` Selects driver for ``DKEXT``."
msgstr "``DKEXT`` 选择 ``DKEXT`` 的驱动程序。"

msgid ""
"``DKEXT=-1``: use paging algorithm (minimum memory). This is automatically "
"used if in-core algorithm would need more than one integral pass. "
"``DKEXT``\\ =0: use in-core algorithm, no integral triples. ``DKEXT``\\ =1: "
"use in-core algorithm and integral triples. ``DKEXT``\\ =2: use in-core "
"algorithm and integral triples if at least two integrals of a triple differ."
" ``DKEXT``\\ =3: use in-core algorithm and integral triples if all integrals"
" of a triple differ."
msgstr ""
"``DKEXT=-1``\\ ：使用分页算法（最小内存）。若内存内算法需要多于一次积分通过，则自动使用该算法。\\ ``DKEXT``\\ "
"=0：使用内存内算法，不使用积分三元组。\\ ``DKEXT``\\ =1：使用内存内算法和积分三元组。\\ ``DKEXT``\\ "
"=2：若三元组中至少两个积分不同，则使用内存内算法和积分三元组。\\ ``DKEXT``\\ "
"=3：若三元组中所有积分均不同，则使用内存内算法和积分三元组。"

msgid ""
"``MAXCEN_DKEXT`` Maximum number of centres in merged shells (0: no limit)."
msgstr "``MAXCEN_DKEXT`` 合并壳层中的最大中心数（0：无限制）。"

msgid "``SCREEN_DKEXT`` Enables of disables screening in ``DKEXT``."
msgstr "``SCREEN_DKEXT`` 启用或禁用 ``DKEXT`` 中的筛选。"

msgid "``PRINT_DKEXT`` Print parameter for ``DKEXT``."
msgstr "``PRINT_DKEXT`` ``DKEXT`` 的打印参数。"

msgid ""
"``SWAP_DKEXT`` Enables of disables label swapping in ``DKEXT`` (test purpose"
" only)"
msgstr "``SWAP_DKEXT`` 启用或禁用 ``DKEXT`` 中的标签交换（仅用于测试目的）"

msgid ""
"``MXMBLK_DKEXT`` Largest matrix block size in ``DKEXT`` (only used with "
"``DKEXT``\\ :math:`\\ge 1`)."
msgstr "``MXMBLK_DKEXT`` ``DKEXT`` 中最大的矩阵块尺寸（仅在 ``DKEXT``\\ :math:`\\ge 1` 时使用）。"

msgid ""
"**\\*\\*Thresholds for integral-direct computation of external exchange "
"operators (``DKEXT``):**\\*\\*"
msgstr "**\\*\\*外部交换算符积分直接计算的阈值（``DKEXT``）：**\\*\\*"

msgid "``THREST_DKEXT`` Prescreening threshold for ``DKEXT``."
msgstr "``THREST_DKEXT`` ``DKEXT`` 的预筛选阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_DKEXT, THREST, default].``"
msgstr "``Defaults: [THR_DKEXT, THREST, default].``"

msgid "``THRINT_DKEXT`` Integral threshold for ``DKEXT``."
msgstr "``THRINT_DKEXT`` ``DKEXT`` 的积分阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_DKEXT, THRINT, default].``"
msgstr "``Defaults: [THR_DKEXT, THRINT, default].``"

msgid "``THRPROD_DKEXT`` Product threshold for ``DKEXT``."
msgstr "``THRPROD_DKEXT`` ``DKEXT`` 的乘积阈值。"

msgid "``Defaults: [THR_DKEXT, THRPROD, default].``"
msgstr "``Defaults: [THR_DKEXT, THRPROD, default].``"

msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

msgid ""
":math:`\\Delta E` is the requested accuracy in the energy (default 1.d-6)."
msgstr ":math:`\\Delta E` 是能量所要求的精度（默认 1.d-6）。"

msgid ""
"The thresholds are reduced if the overlap matrix has small eigenvalues."
msgstr "如果重叠矩阵具有小本征值，则阈值会降低。"

msgid ""
"The default thresholds for DMP2 and LMP2 are :math:`0.1 \\cdot {\\Delta E}`."
msgstr "DMP2 和 LMP2 的默认阈值为 :math:`0.1 \\cdot {\\Delta E}`\\ 。"

msgid "examples/h2o_direct.inp"
msgstr "examples/h2o_direct.inp"
